        "title": {
          "en": "Claude Shared Chats Indexed by Google",
          "zh": "Claude共享对话被谷歌收录"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Anthropic's Claude AI shared chats and Artifacts, accessible via public links, have been indexed by Google, making them discoverable through search.",
          "zh": "Anthropic的Claude AI共享对话和工件（Artifacts）通过公开链接被谷歌收录，导致其可通过搜索被发现。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The issue originates from Claude's \"share chat\" feature.",
            "This feature allows users to create public links to view conversations or projects.",
            "Shared chats and Artifacts associated with these public links have become discoverable via Google searches."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "问题源于Claude的“共享对话”功能。",
            "此功能允许用户创建公开链接以查看对话或项目。",
            "与这些公开链接相关的共享对话和工件（Artifacts）已被谷歌搜索收录，导致可被发现。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This incident highlights potential privacy concerns and unintended data exposure risks associated with AI platforms' sharing features. It underscores the importance of user awareness regarding the public discoverability of shared content.",
          "zh": "此事件凸显了与AI平台共享功能相关的潜在隐私问题和意外数据暴露风险。它强调了用户对共享内容公共可发现性的认识重要性。"
        },
        "source": "404 Media",
        "link": "https://www.404media.co/tons-of-peoples-claude-chats-and-creations-are-exposed-on-google/"
      },
