            "当前AI代理能够交换数据，但尚未能有效协调其行动。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This collaboration signals a focus on developing more robust and reliable AI systems. Addressing AI bioresilience and multi-agent coordination limitations is crucial for the deployment of advanced AI in sensitive applications like healthcare, which currently face challenges in integrating distinct AI expert systems effectively.",
